{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026laPxF1yzAw1795734566.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>歐洲央行的會議紀要顯示，通脹前景惡化，未來或需要進一步加息。</p><p></p><p>歐洲央行上月的議息會議決定維持利率不變，部分委員甚至擔心，物價升幅到2028年後，才能回到央行百分之2的目標水平。因此支持繼續採取審慎政策應對，若後續數據提供充分證據，隨時準備加大政策力度，也符合逐次會議作出決定的方針。</p><p><br/>展望未來，委員認為，能源價格走勢或在短期內進一步推高通脹，令整體通脹率在未來幾個季度，持續遠高於目標水平。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T00:04:28.885878+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":195,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T23:08:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T16:37:35.294379+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T23:57:37.186393+00:00","content_hash":"5fa661fde574e301bfaf7ad959ff8856fe15750179608a73c680c1854d0ccd9d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-27T00:04:28.885878+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}